<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>ORION STAR GAMING</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1020;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #111a33;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #27345c;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #cbd3e8;
    }

    nav {
      background: #080d19;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111a33, #18264a);
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #d4dbed;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .section {
      background: #111a33;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #27345c;
    }

    .section h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .games {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .game-card {
      background: #18264a;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .game-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .notice {
      background: #211d12;
      border: 1px solid #665522;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #080d19;
      color: #aeb7cc;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      nav a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 5px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>⭐ ORION STAR GAMING ⭐</h1>
    <p>Online Gaming Information Center</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#games">Games</a>
    <a href="#how">How It Works</a>
    <a href="#security">Security</a>
    <a href="#responsible">Responsible Gaming</a>
    <a href="#legal">Legal Information</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <h2>Welcome to ORION STAR GAMING</h2>
    <p>
      Explore gaming information, featured games and helpful resources
      in one place.
    </p>
  </section>

  <main class="container">

    <section class="section" id="games">
      <h2>🎮 Featured Games</h2>
      <p>Explore our featured gaming categories.</p>

      <div class="games">
        <div class="game-card">
          <h3>🎰 Casino Games</h3>
          <p>Gaming information and guides.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="game-card">
          <h3>🃏 Card Games</h3>
          <p>Learn about different card games.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="game-card">
          <h3>🎯 Arcade Games</h3>
          <p>Discover entertaining game categories.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>⭐ Popular Games</h2>
      <p>
        Browse popular gaming categories and learn how different games work.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="how">
      <h2>📖 How Gaming Works</h2>
      <p>
        Learn the basic rules, features and terminology used in different
        types of online games.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="security">
      <h2>🔐 Security & Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Protect your personal information and use strong passwords.
        Always check the privacy and security information of any service
        before using it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="responsible">
      <h2>⚠️ Responsible Gaming</h2>
      <p>
        Gaming involving money can carry financial risks. Never spend money
        you cannot afford to lose, and take breaks when needed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="legal">
      <h2>📍 Legal Information</h2>

      <div class="notice">
        <p>
          Gaming and gambling laws vary by U.S. state and jurisdiction.
          Availability and legal requirements may differ by location.
          Check applicable local laws and licensing requirements before
          participating in any real-money gaming activity.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <h2>📞 Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        For general website and gaming-information questions, contact us
        through your official support channel.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 ORION STAR GAMING — Online Gaming Information Center
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
